  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞３Ｆ　摊位街\n　“甜蜜地狱”前……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_822.bf.json:0:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞遇到了正在看海报的雪子。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_822.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 06 01 01 01 05 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 85 04}啊，{F1 81}。\n你看这个。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_822.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞雪子指着一张搞笑大赛的传单。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_822.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3E 04}说是学生们的搞笑表演。\n我有点想看看。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_822.bf.json:3:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}竟然想让全校学生捧腹大笑，\n真有勇气呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_822.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞雪子似乎是在夸奖他们……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_822.bf.json:4:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 01 01 0D 01 01 01 04 01}＞向雪子讲了Ｘ先生的委托。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_822.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3A 04}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}Ｘ先生……？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_822.bf.json:5:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 35 04}感觉有点可疑……\n是个什么样的人？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_822.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}像偶像一样的人{F5 47 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_822.bf.json:6:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}像喜剧演员一样的人{F5 47 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_822.bf.json:6:2",
  "message_id": "SEL_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}不可疑的人{F5 47 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_822.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 07 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 4F 04}偶像……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_822.bf.json:7:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}虽然那也挺厉害的……\n不过我不太会滑旱冰。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_822.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞雪子似乎不感兴趣……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_822.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 03 01 05 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3D 04}喜剧演员……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_822.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0092",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 04 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3F 04}那这位Ｘ先生\n也是个很有勇气的人呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_822.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞雪子似乎产生了兴趣。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_822.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 07 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 7F 04}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}就算你这么说……\n不，反而更让人\n难以信任了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_822.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞雪子似乎很为难……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_822.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 18 04}……我考虑一下吧。\n谢谢你邀请我。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_822.bf.json:14:1",
